{"1999320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sailist", "steam_appid": 1999320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999320/extras/8a9a1dc73bde38d9c2b607bdcecab936.poster.avif?t=1778747256\" width=700 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999320/extras/8a9a1dc73bde38d9c2b607bdcecab936.webm?t=1778747256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999320/extras/8a9a1dc73bde38d9c2b607bdcecab936.mp4?t=1778747256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Free Seas, Infinite Possibilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From peaceful voyages admiring the horizon to ruthless raids annihilating enemy fleets, <strong>the ocean of Sailist is a truly infinite realm with no invisible walls to block your path.</strong> Venture beyond the horizon into the unknown and forge your own destiny. Experience every aspect of life at sea through seamless 1st and 3rd-person perspectives, and become the true sovereign of the boundless ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Merchant of the High Seas: Your Golden Trade Route</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every port town possesses its own unique environment and specialty goods. Go beyond simple logistics—complete town requests to build trust and increase your <strong>Contribution</strong>. Higher reputation unlocks exclusive, high-quality trade goods that ordinary merchants can't even glimpse. Read the market, find the most profitable ports, and establish your own <strong>Golden Trade Route</strong>. The wealth you amass will become the foundation for a massive fleet and your mercantile empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical Mastery: The Art of Fleet Command</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999320/extras/62464f3f5921aef52a2359acb6ec2ee8.poster.avif?t=1778747256\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999320/extras/62464f3f5921aef52a2359acb6ec2ee8.webm?t=1778747256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999320/extras/62464f3f5921aef52a2359acb6ec2ee8.mp4?t=1778747256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When pirate flags crest the horizon, it is time to prove your tactical intuition. Combat in <strong>Sailist</strong> is about more than just firing cannons; it is about maintaining optimal formations and fleet maneuvers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Direct your combat vessels to flank the enemy for a devastating broadside, while commanding your vulnerable transport ships into immediate <strong>evasive maneuvers</strong>. It is your role to designate actions for every ship and adjust formations in real-time amidst the crashing waves. A decisive victory is born from a <strong>perfectly executed formation</strong> and your flawless <strong>fleet management</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Cabin: A Sanctuary on the Waves</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999320/extras/812bb51fbabb791ab0a4d74ab6e274f5.poster.avif?t=1778747256\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999320/extras/812bb51fbabb791ab0a4d74ab6e274f5.webm?t=1778747256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999320/extras/812bb51fbabb791ab0a4d74ab6e274f5.mp4?t=1778747256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ship is more than a vessel—it is a sanctuary reflecting your personal taste. Decorate your cabin with a wide array of items, from essential <strong>compasses</strong> to <strong>fine masterpieces</strong> collected from across the globe. Use the free-placement system to transform your ship's interior into a space of true prestige.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From Desolate Shores to Golden Harbors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999320/extras/117a32b8f1e749f19147481b878dd91b.poster.avif?t=1778747256\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999320/extras/117a32b8f1e749f19147481b878dd91b.webm?t=1778747256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999320/extras/117a32b8f1e749f19147481b878dd91b.mp4?t=1778747256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim the vacant lands you discover as your own sovereign territory. Transport construction materials to build ports and structures, creating <strong>your very own town</strong>. As your settlement develops, you will secure vital resources and strategic advantages. Your vision and design will become the key to efficiently ruling the vast ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rally Under Your Nation's Colors (Online)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999320/extras/db12fb64cea90ec5aec12fab163badee.poster.avif?t=1778747256\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999320/extras/db12fb64cea90ec5aec12fab163badee.webm?t=1778747256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999320/extras/db12fb64cea90ec5aec12fab163badee.mp4?t=1778747256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in <strong>Online Nation Competitions</strong> to form the strongest ties with key NPC towns. By completing town requests and hunting pirates, you contribute to your nation’s standing in the <strong>shared world</strong>, helping your country become the town's primary ally.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Allied</strong> <strong>Nation Selection:</strong> The nation with the highest weekly contribution points will be selected as the town's official ally.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alliance</strong> <strong>Benefits:</strong> Enjoy powerful economic advantages, such as exclusive store discounts, and exert your influence over the world as a member of the presiding nation.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999320/extras/8a9a1dc73bde38d9c2b607bdcecab936.poster.avif?t=1778747256\" width=700 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999320/extras/8a9a1dc73bde38d9c2b607bdcecab936.webm?t=1778747256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999320/extras/8a9a1dc73bde38d9c2b607bdcecab936.mp4?t=1778747256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Free Seas, Infinite Possibilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From peaceful voyages admiring the horizon to ruthless raids annihilating enemy fleets, <strong>the ocean of Sailist is a truly infinite realm with no invisible walls to block your path.</strong> Venture beyond the horizon into the unknown and forge your own destiny. Experience every aspect of life at sea through seamless 1st and 3rd-person perspectives, and become the true sovereign of the boundless ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Merchant of the High Seas: Your Golden Trade Route</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every port town possesses its own unique environment and specialty goods. Go beyond simple logistics—complete town requests to build trust and increase your <strong>Contribution</strong>. Higher reputation unlocks exclusive, high-quality trade goods that ordinary merchants can't even glimpse. Read the market, find the most profitable ports, and establish your own <strong>Golden Trade Route</strong>. The wealth you amass will become the foundation for a massive fleet and your mercantile empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical Mastery: The Art of Fleet Command</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999320/extras/62464f3f5921aef52a2359acb6ec2ee8.poster.avif?t=1778747256\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999320/extras/62464f3f5921aef52a2359acb6ec2ee8.webm?t=1778747256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999320/extras/62464f3f5921aef52a2359acb6ec2ee8.mp4?t=1778747256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When pirate flags crest the horizon, it is time to prove your tactical intuition. Combat in <strong>Sailist</strong> is about more than just firing cannons; it is about maintaining optimal formations and fleet maneuvers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Direct your combat vessels to flank the enemy for a devastating broadside, while commanding your vulnerable transport ships into immediate <strong>evasive maneuvers</strong>. It is your role to designate actions for every ship and adjust formations in real-time amidst the crashing waves. A decisive victory is born from a <strong>perfectly executed formation</strong> and your flawless <strong>fleet management</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Cabin: A Sanctuary on the Waves</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999320/extras/812bb51fbabb791ab0a4d74ab6e274f5.poster.avif?t=1778747256\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999320/extras/812bb51fbabb791ab0a4d74ab6e274f5.webm?t=1778747256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999320/extras/812bb51fbabb791ab0a4d74ab6e274f5.mp4?t=1778747256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ship is more than a vessel—it is a sanctuary reflecting your personal taste. Decorate your cabin with a wide array of items, from essential <strong>compasses</strong> to <strong>fine masterpieces</strong> collected from across the globe. Use the free-placement system to transform your ship's interior into a space of true prestige.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From Desolate Shores to Golden Harbors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999320/extras/117a32b8f1e749f19147481b878dd91b.poster.avif?t=1778747256\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"http