y.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alliance</strong> <strong>Benefits:</strong> Enjoy powerful economic advantages, such as exclusive store discounts, and exert your influence over the world as a member of the presiding nation.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Expand your fleet and embark on a thrilling adventure across infinite seas! From serene healing voyages to strategic raids, carve your path. Use your spoils to forge a legendary route toward the unknown world beyond the horizon. Complete your destiny!", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Turkish, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999320/header.jpg?t=1778747256", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999320/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778747256", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999320/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778747256", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows® 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> intel i5-6600 @ 3.3GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows® 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7-7700k @ 4.2GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 2060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Stora